<title>CROATIA: Croatian July real wages up 4.3 pct, 8.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatian July real wages up 4.3 pct, 8.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		  JULY	  JUNE	JULY'95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)    108.8	104.3	 100.2</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,071	1,994	 1,798</p>
<p>NOTE - July nominal wages rose to 2,058 from 1,951 kuna in June in the goods and services sector. They fell to 2,108 from 2,114 kuna in the public sector. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
